From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:32:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1633/3799] soh: rename func_8096F26C ->
 DemoEc_AdvanceToUpdate18

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: when the current animation has finished it starts gDemoEcAnim_006220 and moves on to EC_UPDATE_18.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c
index bc2cf4621..54dda52cf 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c
@@ -816,7 +816,8 @@ void DemoEc_SetupUpdate17(DemoEc* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->updateMode = EC_UPDATE_17;
 }
 
-void func_8096F26C(DemoEc* this, s32 arg1) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8096F26C: when the current animation has finished it starts gDemoEcAnim_006220 and moves on to EC_UPDATE_18.
+void DemoEc_AdvanceToUpdate18(DemoEc* this, s32 arg1) {
     if (arg1 != 0) {
         DemoEc_ChangeAnimation(this, &gDemoEcAnim_006220, 0, 0.0f, false);
         this->updateMode = EC_UPDATE_18;
@@ -855,7 +856,7 @@ void func_8096F378(DemoEc* this, PlayState* play) {
     DemoEc_MoveActor(this, play);  // was func_8096D594 [LLM:HIGH]
     DemoEc_UpdateEyesAfterFrame32(this);  // was func_8096F1D4 [LLM:HIGH]
     DemoEc_UpdateBgFlags(this, play);
-    func_8096F26C(this, animDone);
+    DemoEc_AdvanceToUpdate18(this, animDone);  // was func_8096F26C [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void func_8096F3D4(DemoEc* this, PlayState* play) {
